  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'raw-turquoise-necklace-december-birthstone-minimalist-gemstone-jewelry', '4558927646', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4558927646/raw-turquoise-necklace-turquoise-pendant?click_key=EuQMwxqQ_dYzSTMiTS0kRaxyg217%3ALT75de68516ee91066aa864bc633cc4c8e3a982d20&click_sum=baff8961&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-142287-19-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search',
   'Raw Turquoise Necklace, December Birthstone, Minimalist Gemstone Jewelry', 'Our Raw Turquoise Necklace features a petite piece of genuine turquoise in its beautifully natural form. Each stone is held delicately in a minimal four-prong setting, allowing its vibrant blue-green color, organic texture, and natural matrix to take center stage. Turquoise has long been associated with protection, strength, and positive energy—a meaningful stone believed to encourage truth, confidence, and a greater sense of balance. It’s the kind of piece meant to be worn as a quiet reminder to trust your own voice and keep moving forward with courage. As a December birthstone, turquoise makes a thoughtful birthday gift for someone born in December, but its meaning goes far beyond a birth month. It’s a beautiful gift for a new beginning, big life change, personal milestone, or simply for someone who could use a little extra strength and encouragement. Each piece of turquoise is naturally unique, with variations in shape, size, color, texture, and matrix. Some stones may be brighter blue, others more blue-green, with varying amounts of natural veining—no two necklaces will look exactly alike. Available in gold or silver, with your choice of necklace length. Delicate, lightweight, and easy to wear alone or layered with your everyday favorites. Thoughtfully packaged and ready for gifting.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
