  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'kingman-arizona-turquoise-ring-sterling-silver-long-oval-shield-statement-band-o', '4565334567', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4565334567/kingman-arizona-turquoise-ring-sterling?click_key=EuQMwxqQ_dYzSTMiTS0kRaxyg217%3ALT0cdd7d2d43e0c60fb457e58ecb72621a91c71e94&click_sum=0dc3b845&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-142287-19-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&pop=1',
   'Kingman Arizona Turquoise Ring, Sterling Silver Long Oval Shield Statement Band, Oxidized Beaded Tribal Jewelry, Handmade Boho Gift for Her', '✨ 🌟 Welcome to BohoMysticSilver 🌟 ✨ 🔮 Handmade Boho-Chic Jewelry: Awaken Your Inner Mystic 🔮 📝 Description: ✨ Step into a world of magic, mystery, and mindful style with our curated collection of handmade jewelry. 🌟 BohoMysticSilver brings you an enchanting realm of rings, earrings, pendants, cuffs, and anklets crafted with soulful artistry, genuine gemstones, and the premium metals of your choice. 💎 🔨 Each piece is lovingly handcrafted by skilled artisans, infusing raw bohemian energy and mystical charm into every detail. 🌿 In our collection, you will discover the perfect harmony of free-spirited gypsy vibes, cosmic symbolism, and vintage-inspired designs that speak directly to your soul and elevate your everyday style. 🌙 👁️ Whether you are searching for a statement raw-crystal ring, delicate crescent moon earrings, a protective talisman pendant, or a layered gemstone anklet, our unique range is designed to help you express your individuality and connect with your inner magic. 🧙‍♀️ 🎒 Our boho-mystical jewelry is built to last, offering premium durability so you can carry your sacred adornments on all of life''s adventures. 🌍 They also make deeply meaningful, intention-filled gifts for the free spirits and dreamers in your life. 🎁 💫 Explore our collection today, align with your unique energy, and find the perfect handmade treasure to complement your bohemian spirit! 🕊️ 🌿 Note on Metals: Each of our mystical designs is custom-crafted using the exact high-quality material you select at checkout—whether that is Premium Pure Silver, Pure Copper, or Pure Brass. ⚙️ ✨ Key Features: * 🔨 100% Handcrafted Artisan Designs * 💎 Made with Premium Pure Silver, Pure Copper, or Pure Brass (as selected) * 🔮 Ethically Sourced Mystic Gemstones * 🌙 Boho, Gypsy, and Celestial Styles * 🗺️ Durable and Adventure-Ready Quality * 🎁 Perfect for Mindful Self-Adornment or Gifting ✨ At BohoMysticSilver, our jewelry is created to celebrate life’s spiritual journeys and cosmi', 'turquoise-jewelry',
