  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'blue-and-sparkly-silver-rhinestone-pendant-statement-necklace-turquoise-tornado-', '1426488405', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1426488405/turquoise-silver-rhinestone-statement?click_key=EuQMwxqQ_dYzSTMiTS0kRaxyg217%3ALTa12d5bd88a1bad2e32d7727cd8b6c4503923ffb3&click_sum=14c89486&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-142287-19-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Blue and Sparkly Silver Rhinestone Pendant Statement Necklace: Turquoise Tornado, 20"', 'This abstract necklace has a fluid appeal. It''s an organic design inspired by nature. We call this the Tornado Necklace, a modern geometric whirl of turquoise and silver pieces with rhinestones. You asked for earrings that match a specific necklace sold in the shop and we delivered! These earrings coordinate with a Wink and Flip necklace to create a matching set!! Enjoy! Kathy of Charleston, SC said, "This item was beautiful and made me feel like a million dollars…I built my whole wedding outfit around it! They also helped me get it on time with short notice. It was perfect!" Sherry from Texas bought this necklace in green, saying: "Beautiful and I have received many compliments on it. Love love♥️♥️♥️" John from MA gave this gift a 5-star review and said: "Such a striking statement piece!" Size: 18 inches plus a 3" extender. 21" total. Wink and Flip, a STAR SELLER, celebrates 14 years on Etsy. We’ve earned over 3,333 5-star reviews in over 15,000 sales to women with style! All sales are final, but please message us if you have a question or issue. We work with our customers. Our Story When you buy something from Wink and Flip, you buy a little piece of New York City, the world''s fashion capital. We reduce, reuse, and recycle. And our pieces are guaranteed to get compliments! Meet Natasha Now a mother of two, Natasha spent her college years in the accessories departments of Teen Vogue and Marie Claire under top editors Taylor Tomasi Hill and Eva Chen. After studying at the Fashion Institute of Technology, she started selling at markets around New York City before premiering her line at the famous holiday fairs in Bryant Park and Union Square!', 'statement-pieces',
