  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'antique-sterling-turquoise-screw-back-earrings', '1349964363', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1349964363/antique-sterling-turquoise-screw-back?click_key=9dac90a5-3c71-408d-b39a-03989293153d%3ALT57e4bd8220684fd27d042b3420f3d098e3d38650&click_sum=f6045680&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1013658-19-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1&content_source=9dac90a5-3c71-408d-b39a-03989293153d%253ALT57e4bd8220684fd27d042b3420f3d098e3d38650',
   'Antique Sterling Turquoise Screw Back Earrings', 'Up for your consideration are these breathtaking Antique Sterling Silver Earrings. These earrings feature a gorgeously ornate angel on top with intricate raised swirls and orbs throughout that are accented with three small turquoises. The complexity of these earrings are completely out of this world! Masterfully crafted. Pictures best describe. Excellent condition, no dents or damage. Do note, these earrings are screw backs but I do believe they were once french wires. Sometime in its lifetime these earrings were converted into screws. If these earrings do not sell, I plan to get them converted back into french wire backings for pierced ears. When I convert them back, I will be raising the price exponentially. But for now I have them listed at half of what they''re really worth. Measurement is Approx.: 7/8" by 5/8". Each Earring Weighs Approx.: 4 Grams (8 grams total). I tested these earrings with acid and they are guaranteed to be sterling silver. Great antique find, being offered at a reasonable price. E-mail me with any questions you may have prior to purchase.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
