  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'kingman-turquoise-natural-gemstone-925-stealing-silver-handmade-necklace', '4555096653', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4555096653/kingman-turquoise-natural-gemstone-925?click_key=EuQMwxqQ_dYzSTMiTS0kRaxyg217%3ALTd966ab8b1972cae88594d45a3bea4effbab14241&click_sum=53d59925&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1013657-19-4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&pop=1',
   'Kingman turquoise natural gemstone 925 stealing silver handmade necklace', 'Discover the timeless beauty of the Kingman turquoise natural gemstone with this exquisite handmade necklace. Crafted with care from genuine 925 sterling silver, this piece combines artistry and nature’s elegance to create a stunning accessory perfect for any style. Centered around a captivating Kingman turquoise stone, renowned for its vibrant blue-green hues and unique matrix patterns, this necklace captures the essence of desert landscapes and southwestern charm. Each gemstone is carefully selected for its quality and natural beauty, making every necklace one-of-a-kind. Whether you''re dressing up for a special occasion or adding a touch of boho elegance to your everyday look, this necklace is versatile and eye-catching. Its handcrafted design ensures a high-quality finish that feels as good as it looks. Key features: - Materials: Natural Kingman turquoise gemstone, 925 sterling silver - Length: [Insert dimensions] for a comfortable fit - Handmade craftsmanship with attention to detail - A perfect gift for lovers of natural gemstones, southwestern jewelry, or unique handcrafted accessories Care instructions: - Keep away from harsh chemicals - Store in a jewelry box or soft pouch - Clean gently with a soft cloth to maintain its shine Add a piece of natural artistry to your jewelry collection with this stunning Kingman turquoise gemstone necklace. Embrace the beauty of nature and the craftsmanship of handmade jewelry today!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
