  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'big-sale-kingman-az-turquoise-old-stock-rough-500-carat-lot-high-end-a-free-face', '1507748919', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1507748919/big-sale-500-carat-lots-of-old-stock?click_key=EuQMwxqQ_dYzSTMiTS0kRaxyg217%3ALT3a06e3c27fa2e354a2664a3c3a3a4f67ee02160c&click_sum=021caa21&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1013657-19-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&bes=1',
   'Big Sale!! Kingman, AZ Turquoise Old Stock Rough (500 Carat Lot) High End + A Free Faceted Gemstone', '500 Carat bag of High End Turquoise!!!!! + A Very Nice Free Faceted Gemstone!!! This listing is your opportunity to receive High End Stabilized Turquoise Rough at a very inexpensive price. This Turquoise was mined in Kingman Arizona which has produced some of the world’s most expensive and nicest Turquoise specimens in the world. We will be dividing the stones up into 500-carat lot for this listing. Turquoise is sacred to both Native American and oriental traditions. It is associated with the sky and bringing sky energy to earth. It can help promote honest and clear communication from the heart. It is also said to protect against pollution in the environment and to bring abundance. Turquoise can also help speed the healing process and is known as a master healer stone. It is very powerful for grounding and protection also. Turquoise is associated with the throat chakra primarily. Each bag will contain 500 Carats of Turquoise plus a FREE FACETED GEMSTONE (Buy 2 bag and receive 2 free faceted gemstones, etc…). Each lot will contain pieces that range in size from 10 carats to over 100 carats each. The pictures were taken with the stones wet to show the color better. Shipping Details: Most orders are shipped within one business day. Buy with confidence! 100 % satisfaction guaranteed. If for whatever reason you are unhappy with your order, return for a full refund. You will receive a very similar lot, however, you will not receive the exact lot pictured.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
