   'Sterling Silver Witchy Kitty Pendant: White Water Turquoise, Moonstone (52mm)', 'THE CAT YOU ARE MAGIC Elegance, curiosity, independence, protection, and magic _______ ABOUT THE STONES A glowing white moonstone has been set atop a witches hat. White Water Turquoise has been set as the body. White Water Turquoise is considered rare and highly collectable. _____________________________________________________ ABOUT THE CREATING Sterling silver The Cat is roughly 2" (52mm) in height and 3/4" (20mm) in width. _________________________________________ CHOOSING YOUR CHAIN - CHAIN LENGTH A sterling silver rope chain ships with your pendant. Please choose your length from the drop down menu. If you are wanting a semi handcrafted, more durable, sterling silver chain, you can find one here... https://www.etsy.com/listing/864021329/chromafusion-jewelry-signature-chain _________________________________________ SHIPPING *UNITED STATES USPS FIRST CLASS - $10(2-5 DAYS) USPS PRIORITY - $12 (1-3 DAYS) If you would like to ensure your item for its full dollar amount, please inform me upon purchase so I can invoice you for an estimated amount. ________ *INTERNATIONAL Please know international shipping cost is different with every country. If I have over charged you, I will reimburse. If your country allows, I will ship this item usps priority international mail due to the cost of the item. What your customs charges you is out of my control. ___________________________________________ CARE This necklace is a piece of artwork. Please treat it like one. My creations are built to last a lifetime, however, please refrain from rough, dirty, and especially wet activity while wearing my original creations. Please be conscience that my creations are hand fabricated with high grade materials and that swimming, gardening, or any kind of sport may (and most likely will) harm them. Please do not use house hold cleaners or jewelry cleaners with harsh chemicals. I highly suggest using a sunshine cloth to clean all of my creations. ________________________________________________', 'turquoise-jewelry',
